cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use mcp-bench in your research or tooling evaluation, please cite it as below."
title: "mcp-bench: an authorization-logic detection benchmark for MCP security scanners"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "StellarRequiem"
repository-code: "https://github.com/StellarRequiem/mcp-bench"
license: Apache-2.0
date-released: 2026-06-30
abstract: >
  An independent, reproducible benchmark measuring whether MCP security scanners
  detect authorization-logic vulnerabilities (broken object-level auth, mass
  assignment, confused deputy, scope elevation) versus only generic/syntactic
  classes. Labeled corpus, pre-registered scoring methodology, and Wilson
  95% confidence intervals on every detection-rate figure.
